<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Cisco AI Network Analytics is part of Cisco's DNA Center (now Catalyst Center) platform, bringing machine learning and artificial intelligence to enterprise network management. It represents Cisco's vision for intent-based networking — where networks understand business intent and automatically configure themselves to meet those goals.</p>
<p>The platform analyzes data from across your Cisco infrastructure — switches, routers, wireless controllers, and endpoints — to provide predictive insights, detect anomalies before they cause outages, and automate troubleshooting. For organizations running Cisco Catalyst or Meraki infrastructure, it's the natural choice for AI-powered network operations.</p>
<p>What sets Cisco AI apart is its deep integration with Cisco hardware and software. Unlike third-party monitoring tools, Cisco AI understands the specific capabilities of Cisco devices and can take automated remediation actions through DNA Center's policy engine.</p>
<div class="cisco-highlight">
<h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg> Intent-Based Networking</h4>
<p style="margin: 0;">Define your business intent (e.g., "prioritize video conferencing traffic"), and Cisco AI translates it into network configurations across your entire infrastructure automatically.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="features">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M18 17V9"/><path d="M13 17V5"/><path d="M8 17v-3"/></svg> Predictive Analytics</h4><p>Machine learning models predict network issues before they impact users. Identifies capacity constraints, device failures, and performance degradation trends.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z"></path><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="9" y2="13"></line><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="17" y2="17"></line></svg> Anomaly Detection</h4><p>Automatically detects unusual patterns in network behavior. Identifies security threats, misconfigurations, and performance issues in real-time.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg> Auto Remediation</h4><p>Automatically fixes common issues without human intervention. Can reboot access points, adjust QoS policies, and reconfigure switches based on detected problems.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.55a11 11 0 0 1 14.08 0"/><path d="M1.42 9a16 16 0 0 1 21.16 0"/><path d="M8.53 16.11a6 6 0 0 1 6.95 0"/><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="20" y2="20"/></svg> Wireless Optimization</h4><p>AI-driven wireless network optimization. Automatically adjusts channel assignments, power levels, and roaming parameters for optimal client experience.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg> Client 360</h4><p>Complete visibility into client behavior and experience. Track individual devices across wired and wireless networks with health scores and issue history.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="20" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="20" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="20" y2="14"></line></svg> Assurance Dashboard</h4><p>Single-pane-of-glass view of network health. Color-coded dashboards show issues at a glance with drill-down capabilities for root cause analysis.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg> Meraki Integration</h4><p>Extends AI analytics to Meraki cloud-managed networks. Unified view across Catalyst and Meraki infrastructure with consistent AI insights.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="20" rx="2" ry="2" width="14" x="5" y="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg> ThousandEyes Integration</h4><p>Combines internal network insights with internet and SaaS monitoring. End-to-end visibility from user to cloud application.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
