<h3><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="15" x2="9" y1="9" y2="15"></line><line x1="9" x2="15" y1="9" y2="15"></line></svg> Disadvantages</h3>
<ul>
<li>Expensive — enterprise pricing only</li>
<li>Cisco-centric — limited multi-vendor support</li>
<li>Complex deployment and configuration</li>
<li>Requires DNA Center infrastructure</li>
<li>Steep learning curve</li>
<li>Licensing can be confusing</li>
